{"about_the_game":"You, a legendary retired veteran, are called upon for one last operation: to ascend a mega-city ruled by a corrupt conglomerate. You were chosen for this mission because of your signature chain-hook prosthetic arm and the ability to maneuver and quickly defeat enemies. The mission: to hunt down a mysterious entity known as \u201cSANABI\u201d and uncover corporate secrets hidden deep within the city.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/479e889f7d8dbee546cba292c93f1e59.poster.avif?t=1764564242\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/479e889f7d8dbee546cba292c93f1e59.webm?t=1764564242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/479e889f7d8dbee546cba292c93f1e59.mp4?t=1764564242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An exhilarating platformer</strong></h2>Your giant chain-hook prosthetic arm acts as both a method for quickly maneuvering around and also a way to swiftly take out your opponents. With your legendary skills, you are capable of using your prosthetic arm to jump over cliffs and skyscrapers, dash through bullets and traps and defeat powerful enemies. It's time for you to come back out of retirement for one last mission.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/afc3190ef33fd0be3560a12048c54883.poster.avif?t=1764564242\" width=630 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/afc3190ef33fd0be3560a12048c54883.webm?t=1764564242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/afc3190ef33fd0be3560a12048c54883.mp4?t=1764564242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A beautiful yet mysterious cyberpunk dystopia</strong></h2>Mega-city \u201cMAGO\u201d is a high-tech city ruled by a corrupt conglomerate\u2026 at least, that\u2019s what it was 24 hours ago. After a sudden blackout, all of its citizens mysteriously disappeared and the city was left in total chaos. It\u2019s your mission to explore the depths of the city and uncover what happened.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/3873e8bb64d608449eb4ef9069b3df28.poster.avif?t=1764564242\" width=630 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/3873e8bb64d608449eb4ef9069b3df28.webm?t=1764564242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/3873e8bb64d608449eb4ef9069b3df28.mp4?t=1764564242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mari, the hacker prodigy</strong></h2>A brilliant hacker and drone rider you meet during your mission. Mari can open locked doors, reveal enemy weaknesses and uncover encrypted information. Mari is lovely and reliable, but maybe just a little too chatty. Who knows though, this girl might be the key to finding SANABI.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/3bec9c8748169c432e3fd1e7b3d69048.poster.avif?t=1764564242\" width=630 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/3bec9c8748169c432e3fd1e7b3d69048.webm?t=1764564242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1562700/extras/3bec9c8748169c432e3fd1e7b3d69048.mp4?t=1764564242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You should have seen who you were attacking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1562700/aa7aafd62d6e7c3930ec3eba5435b4ae80fbdf1f.jpg"},{"name":"City cleaning department","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1562700/e73903bf7277642bff6313af90d87b611e763922.jpg"},{"name":"Fishing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1562700/efd4f4711e1fc6dc3cbff2d775b3fab81587a7eb.jpg"},{"name":"Organizing Positions","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1562700/d689d8ef647c9fd29d2fb74934b9a08ac2d09c50.jpg"},{"name":"Pitiful hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1562700/57f5adcb1387d085f9ccc91fcf9548d1a95e8fc7.jpg"},{"name":"Core Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1562700/85ed97641105ce81dcc62026af6debd91a2980cd.jpg"},{"name":"In the Factory King\u2019s palace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1562700/9ec04385650ef1f54f448a48c60bf0b3c1c1c36f.jpg"},{"name":"Hovering Hellfire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1562700/1a0a4a711073e55369bb9dfbbf5f5b7f812342f4.jpg"},{"name":"Mutiny","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1562700/2532d435ea6f6d80ee8b92c68031b75a5274205d.jpg"},{"name":"The unfolding truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1562700/a45027cf506297c1f908914131fc4280d0b07d04.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1562700?t=1764564242","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/